  "extra_findings": [
    "F2 (sub-item): web listing/search showed every ticket to clients (index.php:73); now filtered via listarChamadosVisiveis, technicians see all (enforcement of the manifest rule)",
    "F2 (sub-item): index.php?export=csv gave every ticket to any session (index.php:45); web export now filtered per client via exportarCsvVisivel, sessionless exportarCsv() unchanged",
    "F3 (sub-item): getenv('DB_PASS') ?: literal falls back to the production password when DB_PASS is '' or '0' (config.php:12)",
    "F6 (sub-items): fixed shared file EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv under the web tree, never deleted; concurrent exports race on it; export fails silently when the directory is missing (lib.php:125-128)",
    "F7 (sub-items): session cookie without HttpOnly/SameSite/strict mode; array-shaped login/senha/busca parameters raise TypeError (HTTP 500)",
    "F9 (sub-item): mediaResposta pulls every answered row to PHP to sum it (lib.php:109-115); now SUM/COUNT in SQL",
    "F10: since PHP 8.1 a failed new mysqli throws mysqli_sql_exception before the connect_errno check (index.php:9-12); id concatenation in tecnicoNome/verChamado reported as hardening, not as injection",
    "F11: fputcsv without an explicit $escape is deprecated in PHP 8.4 and emits a Deprecated notice per row (lib.php:130,138)",
    "F13 (sub-items): no logout route, no pagination, no CSRF token on the login POST (SEC-005, not planted), no login rate limiting"
